    "description": {
      "value": "The opaque crystal lenses of these sleek goggles don't obscure vision, but rather enhance it. While wearing the goggles, you gain a +1 item bonus to Perception checks involving sight. Once per day, you can use the following action.\n\n**Go Dark**\n\n- **Activate:** 1 Action\n- **Traits:** manipulate\n\nYou carefully rotate the lenses 90 degrees, and you gain darkvision. For 1 hour, you can see just as well in darkness as you can in the light."
